        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-25, Decorative Tip Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Beauty Cabinet Pull is available in 6 finishes including antique english, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze (pictured right). It is perfect for traditional spaces and will add a subtle point of interest to any small cabinet drawer or door. It is easy to install with the provided hardware. This traditional pull has a 3 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-25 3\" Traditional Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nickel-dragonfly.jpg?v=1704354568\" width=\"514\" height=\"126\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
